'''Big Meowth Day''' (Japanese: '''ビック・ニャース・デイ''' ''Biggu Nyāsu Dei'') is the 11th ending theme for [[Pokémon Sunday]]. It replaced [[Spurt!]].

==Ending animation==
===Synopsis===
Meowth, Pikachu and the rest of the Pokémon are enjoying fun in the beach.

